<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net" type="device"><diagram id="dp41-comparison" name="04-41. VIA 요청 이해의 모델 주도와 코드 주도 완성"><mxGraphModel dx="1920" dy="1080" grid="1" gridSize="10" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1920" pageHeight="1080" background="#FFFFFF"><root><mxCell id="0" /><mxCell id="1" parent="0" /><mxCell id="n1" parent="1" vertex="1" value="" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;rounded=0;fillColor=white;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1.7;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="0" y="0" width="1920" height="1080" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n2" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;VIA SOFTWARE ARCHITECTURE / DP 설계 비교&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=19;fontColor=#087E8B;fontStyle=1;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="40" y="22" width="1300" height="24.7" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n3" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;구조 비교 / 장단점 / QA Trade-off&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=right;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=19;fontColor=#5F6B77;fontStyle=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1430" y="22" width="450" height="24.7" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n4" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;04-41. VIA 요청 이해의 모델 주도와 코드 주도 완성&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=39;fontColor=#18232E;fontStyle=1;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="40" y="65" width="1840" height="50.7" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n5" parent="1" edge="1" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;strokeColor=#CDD6DE;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=none;endFill=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1"><mxPoint as="sourcePoint" x="40" y="121" /><mxPoint as="targetPoint" x="1880" y="121" /><Array as="points" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="n6" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;“이 표를 아까 보고서에 넣고, 메일은 초안만 만들어.” / 보고서 Task 후보 2개&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=23;fontColor=#18232E;fontStyle=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="40" y="140" width="1840" height="29.900000000000002" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n7" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;공통: 로컬 VIA / 로컬 VAD / 클라우드 음성 + 의미 LLM / 채택은 코드 / 조회 예시: E7@v2 표, T7/T8 후보, M3 발송 금지&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=17;fontColor=#18232E;fontStyle=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="40" y="169" width="1840" height="22.1" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n8" parent="1" vertex="1" value="" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;rounded=0;fillColor=#D5E7C7;strokeColor=#CDD6DE;strokeWidth=1.7;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="40" y="195" width="1840" height="48" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n9" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;설계안&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=19;fontColor=#18232E;fontStyle=1;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="41.0" y="209" width="98" height="24.7" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n10" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3000000000000003;&quot;&gt;A 모델 주도 해석&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=26;fontColor=#18232E;fontStyle=1;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="156.0" y="205" width="838" height="33.800000000000004" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n11" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3000000000000003;&quot;&gt;B 모델 요청 틀과 코드 주도 완성&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=26;fontColor=#18232E;fontStyle=1;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1026.0" y="205" width="838" height="33.800000000000004" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n12" parent="1" edge="1" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;strokeColor=#CDD6DE;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=none;endFill=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1"><mxPoint as="sourcePoint" x="1010" y="195" /><mxPoint as="targetPoint" x="1010" y="795" /><Array as="points" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="n13" parent="1" edge="1" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;strokeColor=#CDD6DE;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=none;endFill=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1"><mxPoint as="sourcePoint" x="40" y="795" /><mxPoint as="targetPoint" x="1880" y="795" /><Array as="points" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="n14" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;비교 대상: 다음 읽기와 전체 의미 결합의 결정권 / 임시 해석 상태는 Request Interpreter / 채택 의미/질문/출처/revision은 Request Controller&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=17;fontColor=#18232E;fontStyle=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="42" y="810" width="1840" height="22.1" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n15" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;음성/전사 비용은 공통. 재시도/폐기된 모델 호출도 집계. 도구 조회 자체는 모델 호출이 아니며 45의 의미 가공이 추가되면 별도 집계.&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=17;fontColor=#18232E;fontStyle=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="42" y="836" width="1840" height="22.1" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n16" parent="1" edge="1" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;strokeColor=#CDD6DE;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=none;endFill=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1"><mxPoint as="sourcePoint" x="40" y="875" /><mxPoint as="targetPoint" x="1880" y="875" /><Array as="points" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="n17" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;정확성 / 지원 범위&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=18;fontColor=#18232E;fontStyle=1;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="42" y="883" width="245" height="23.400000000000002" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n18" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;열린 의미를 함께 판단 / 검색 누락과 모델 오판 가능&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=18;fontColor=#18232E;fontStyle=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="300" y="883" width="720" height="23.400000000000002" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n19" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;지원 관계의 코드 결합 / 틀 오류와 표현 밖 관계의 한계&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=18;fontColor=#18232E;fontStyle=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1050" y="883" width="820" height="23.400000000000002" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n20" parent="1" edge="1" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;strokeColor=#CDD6DE;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=none;endFill=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1"><mxPoint as="sourcePoint" x="40" y="909" /><mxPoint as="targetPoint" x="1880" y="909" /><Array as="points" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="n21" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;응답성&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=18;fontColor=#18232E;fontStyle=1;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="42" y="917" width="245" height="23.400000000000002" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n22" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;조회 후 재판단마다 클라우드 왕복 / 부분 수정 허용&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=18;fontColor=#18232E;fontStyle=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="300" y="917" width="720" height="23.400000000000002" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n23" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;지원 틀이 충분하면 재판단 축소 / 추가 해석과 질문 대기&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=18;fontColor=#18232E;fontStyle=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1050" y="917" width="820" height="23.400000000000002" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n24" parent="1" edge="1" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;strokeColor=#CDD6DE;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=none;endFill=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1"><mxPoint as="sourcePoint" x="40" y="943" /><mxPoint as="targetPoint" x="1880" y="943" /><Array as="points" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="n25" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;모델 호출 비용&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=18;fontColor=#18232E;fontStyle=1;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="42" y="951" width="245" height="23.400000000000002" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n26" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;반복 해석과 긴 Context가 비용 증가 요인&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=18;fontColor=#18232E;fontStyle=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="300" y="951" width="720" height="23.400000000000002" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n27" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;초기 틀 + 필요한 부분 해석 / 항상 1회라는 전제 없음&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=18;fontColor=#18232E;fontStyle=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1050" y="951" width="820" height="23.400000000000002" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n28" parent="1" edge="1" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;strokeColor=#CDD6DE;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=none;endFill=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1"><mxPoint as="sourcePoint" x="40" y="977" /><mxPoint as="targetPoint" x="1880" y="977" /><Array as="points" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="n29" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;변경 용이성&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=18;fontColor=#18232E;fontStyle=1;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="42" y="985" width="245" height="23.400000000000002" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n30" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;새 관계는 prompt/tool 변경 가능 / 채택 계약 변경은 별도&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=18;fontColor=#18232E;fontStyle=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="300" y="985" width="720" height="23.400000000000002" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n31" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;schema와 Engine 규칙 확장 / 기존 지원 관계는 코드 제어&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=18;fontColor=#18232E;fontStyle=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1050" y="985" width="820" height="23.400000000000002" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n32" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;미선정 / 미측정. B도 부분 의미 판단을 다시 호출할 수 있다. 새 관계의 지원 범위와 질문 비용을 함께 비교한다.&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=17;fontColor=#18232E;fontStyle=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="40" y="1032" width="1840" height="22.1" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n33" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;교환 자료/필드는 검토용 예시 / A도 구조화 출력 가능 / B의 BOUND는 정답 보증이 아님 / 품질 우열과 호출 비용은 측정 전 가설&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=14;fontColor=#5F6B77;fontStyle=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="40" y="1060" width="1840" height="18.2" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n34" parent="1" vertex="1" value="" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;rounded=0;fillColor=white;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1.0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="47" y="277" width="86" height="512" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n35" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;Legend&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=15;fontColor=#000000;fontStyle=1;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="49.0" y="292" wi